sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Use as Critical Report Use
    participant Revoke as Grant Revocation
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Use->>DB: Begin and lock sorted resource rows FOR SHARE
    Use->>DB: Acquire shared organization transaction lock
    Use->>DB: New SQL statement for clock and live policy
    Revoke->>DB: Begin and lock sorted resource rows FOR SHARE
    Revoke->>DB: Request exclusive organization transaction lock
    Note over Revoke,DB: Waits while earlier critical use holds shared lock
    Use->>DB: Validate report references and create durable output
    Use->>DB: Append audit and commit
    DB-->>Revoke: Exclusive organization lock acquired
    Revoke->>DB: Lock membership and check expected version
    Revoke->>DB: New SQL statement for clock and management policy
    Revoke->>DB: Revoke grant by difference and append audit
    Revoke->>DB: Commit

    Use->>DB: New transaction with ordered resource locks
    Use->>DB: Acquire shared organization transaction lock
    Use->>DB: New SQL statement for clock and live policy
    DB-->>Use: Grant is revoked
    Use->>DB: Roll back without creating output
    Note over Use,DB: Publisher archival takes resource FOR UPDATE.<br/>All waits are bounded and expiration is rechecked after waits.<br/>Already committed output precedes the revocation.
